        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-10">
                    <h1 style="line-height:1.2;font-size:25px;margin-bottom:10px;">Learn more about the steps that Kuruva Island Resort & Spa adopts for strict adherence to sanitation, disinfection and epidemic prevention protocols:</h1>
                    <p>Dear guests,</p>
                    <p>Kuruva Island Resort is a luxury resort that offers tranquillity and serenity along the Kabini coast. The spacious facilities and proximity to nature offer the best "natural freeing" to all the guests who come here!</p>
                    <p>The Kuruva Island Resort & Spa is Covid-free and ensures the safety of guests and families alike. Our resort offers comfort and privacy to all guests while allowing them to enjoy the freedom and elegance of natural surroundings in the most secure manner.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Many of our rooms and villas offer a private outdoor deck, a lounge area and private pools with direct access to the beauty of the Kabini River. The Kabini River, which flows endlessly over the rocks, and the surrounding dense forest and lush green outdoor space give guests the feeling that this is their own paradise.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        All guests' arrivals and departures will be checked for temperature, luggage surfaces will be disinfected, and all staff members will be vaccinated in compliance with health and hygiene standards set by the World Health Organization (WHO) and the Indian Medical Association (IMA). In addition, a serological test is performed for Covid-19 every 10 days and a mask is worn at all times.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Every room or villa will have a hygiene kit including hand sanitizer, disinfectant wipes and disposable gloves for guests - these will be readily available in public places. There will be a mobile sterilized UV light disinfectant and electrostatic sprayer with grade disinfectant used to clean the villas between check-ins and all public spaces and furniture. 
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        There will be a medical doctor and a new dedicated hygiene manager here to ensure that new procedures are monitored daily and that guests and staff are safe and comfortable. In addition, the PCR testing facility will be available at home at an extra cost to guests in need. After each guest checks out we make those rooms, pools and bathrooms safe for the next guest with disinfectant without leaving a single corner. In addition, we pay close attention to all areas and public areas of the resort, including Kuruva Island SPA, Gym & Sports Center, Kids Club and Indoor Area.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        As far as our restaurant is concerned, there is a restaurant here that serves international cuisine from all over the world, and we rearranged the seats to ensure that the social distance is comfortable. For those who want to relax in the privacy of their villa, in-room dining facilities are available from the resort butlers who ensure that guests receive a high standard of security.
                        We are happy to welcome our dearest guests with open arms, always fulfilling expectations with astonishing views, exceptional service and safeness!
                        If you have any questions feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:info@kuruvaislandresort.com">info@kuruvaislandresort.com</a>
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-weight:bold;">Thank you for your constant support. <br> Kuruva Island Resort & Spa</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
